WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.828
Adding affixes changes a word's meaning; choose language to suit audience and

00:00:04.828 --> 00:00:05.213
purpose.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.849
What does dis- mean in “disagree”? Answer: Not agree

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:15.196
Change five root words using prefixes or suffixes and write an appropriate message.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.508
Discuss why: Dis- can express opposition.
